  "content": "\n\n<h2>意見回饋與問題</h2>\n<p>發現錯誤或有建議嗎？<br>\n歡迎加入我們的 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/NG8vuDekTT\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Discord</strong></a> 社群！</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>與朋友一起玩！</h2>\n<h3>如何開始</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>透過我的連結前往 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdathost.net%252fr%252ftalhanation%252fminecraft-server-hosting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>DatHost</strong></a></li>\n<li>註冊您的帳號。</li>\n<li>註冊完成後，選擇符合您需求的方案。</li>\n<li>結帳時將<strong>自動套用 30% 折扣</strong>。<strong>重要：</strong>折扣僅在您使用此<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdathost.net%252fr%252ftalhanation%252fminecraft-server-hosting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">**我的連結**</a>訂購伺服器時生效！</li>\n</ol>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdathost.net%252fminecraft-server-hosting%253fref%253dtalhanation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d6ec0353-37bd-4f09-a427-694da9f8c500\" alt=\"DatHost\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>我的其他模組</h2>\n<h3><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fvillager-recruits\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/20dc335a-fdcd-4075-a317-4047c040a020\" alt=\"recruits-icon\"></a></h3>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fvillager-recruits\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>村民招募</strong></a>：<br>\n指揮屬於您的<strong>村民軍隊</strong>投入戰場！現已新增<strong>外交與陣營</strong>功能！</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fvillager-workers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/talhanation/wiki/assets/10392726/7b2f12d9-793a-491f-ba0a-c91bc3bf9e2c\" alt=\"workers-icon\"></a></h3>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fvillager-workers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>村民勞工</strong></a>：<br>\n雇用村民，讓他們<strong>為您工作</strong>！</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsmall-ships\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/talhanation/wiki/assets/10392726/1c579ef7-61a9-404a-bd37-99be59930b5b\" alt=\"smallships-icon\"></a></h3>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsmall-ships\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>小型船隻</strong></a>：<br>\n駕駛屬於您的<strong>可航行船隻</strong>探索海洋！</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>使用授權</h2>\n<p>您可以將小型船隻模組用於任何類型的整合包中，只要您連結回本頁面，且不對該整合包獲利即可。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>主要頁面</h2>\n<p>請前往 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsmall-ships\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Modrinth</strong></a> 上的主要頁面，以獲得關於小型船隻的更多資訊！</p>",
